abstract: "Typed assessment operators, backward recursions, Farkas obstruction certificates, and dashboard readings for sustainability transitions, in exact rational arithmetic. Implements the assessment-operator framework of 'Aggregate Indices and Transition Safety' and the certificate family of 'An Obstruction Calculus for Viability under Incomplete Observation' (A. Abaee); the twenty-four benchmark checks re-derive the values archived in the companion verification deposit."
